WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.435 --> 00:00:02.935
Lesson eight. Numbers!

2
00:00:03.888 --> 00:00:11.138
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.166 --> 00:00:15.136
Let's count! Show me your fingers!

4
00:00:15.186 --> 00:00:16.150
Ready!

5
00:00:16.946 --> 00:00:20.696
One! Say it with me. One!

6
00:00:24.572 --> 00:00:27.805
Two! Say it with me. Two!

7
00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:35.076
Three! Say it with me. Three!

8
00:00:39.074 --> 00:00:42.390
Four! Say it with me. Four!

9
00:00:46.408 --> 00:00:49.925
Five! Say it with me. Five!

10
00:00:53.913 --> 00:01:01.310
Count with me! One, two, three, four, five!

11
00:01:01.360 --> 00:01:05.443
Again! One, two, three, four, five!

12
00:01:08.852 --> 00:01:13.211
How many ducks?

13
00:01:13.261 --> 00:01:15.456
Three! Three ducks!

14
00:01:16.713 --> 00:01:21.225
How many cats?

15
00:01:21.275 --> 00:01:23.511
Two! Two cats!

16
00:01:24.499 --> 00:01:29.187
Clap three times!

17
00:01:29.237 --> 00:01:33.878
Jump two times!

18
00:01:33.928 --> 00:01:35.595
Wave five times!

19
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:42.517
Coco, how many eyes do you have?

20
00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:48.703
Two! Big eyes! How many noses?

21
00:01:48.753 --> 00:01:49.767
One!

22
00:01:50.512 --> 00:01:57.079
This is H. H is for hat. Hat! H is for hen. Hen!

23
00:02:01.071 --> 00:02:08.174
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:08.224 --> 00:02:09.850
Bye-bye, friends!

